</li>
<li data-start="10394" data-end="10464">
<p data-start="10396" data-end="10464">Suits, clothing accessories, beauty kits, and small lifestyle gifts</p>
</li>
<li data-start="10465" data-end="10538">
<p data-start="10467" data-end="10538">Works across physical stores and online fulfilment in the same format</p>
</li>
<li data-start="10539" data-end="10605">
