</li>
<li data-start="6641" data-end="6691">
<p data-start="6643" data-end="6691">Helps when handling multiple items in sequence</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="6693" data-end="6744"><strong data-start="6693" data-end="6744">Consistency Benefits For Regular Store Programs</strong></p>
