</li>
<li data-start="4634" data-end="4673">
<p data-start="4636" data-end="4673">Simple folds that reduce build time</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="4675" data-end="4704"><strong data-start="4675" data-end="4704">DIY Friendly Layout Ideas</strong></p>
